"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"The government has declared a national emergency after a tremor hit at 07:34 local time. This is one of the deadliest Ukrainian drone attacks since Russia's full-scale invasion, with 75 people injured.\",            \"english_title\": \"National Emergency Declared\",            \"translated_version\": \"El gobierno ha declarado una emergencia nacional despu\u00e9s de un temblor a las 07:34 hora local. Este es uno de los ataques de drones ucranianos m\u00e1s mortales desde la invasi\u00f3n de Rusia, con 75 personas heridas.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Emergencia Nacional\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Russia's only liberal, anti-war party will not be allowed to participate in the upcoming parliamentary elections, as ruled by a Moscow court.\",            \"english_title\": \"Liberal Party Barred\",            \"translated_version\": \"El \u00fanico partido liberal y anti-guerra de Rusia no podr\u00e1 participar en las pr\u00f3ximas elecciones parlamentarias, seg\u00fan una corte de Mosc\u00fa.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Partido Liberal Prohibido\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Global oceans experienced their hottest July on record, partly due to developing El Ni\u00f1o conditions. Meanwhile, wildfires continue to devastate western Europe.\",            \"english_title\": \"Hottest July for Oceans\",            \"translated_version\": \"Los oc\u00e9anos del mundo tuvieron su julio m\u00e1s caliente registrado, en parte por las condiciones de El Ni\u00f1o. Mientras tanto, los incendios siguen devastando el oeste de Europa.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Julio M\u00e1s Caliente para Oc\u00e9anos\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"More than 12,000 people had to evacuate over the weekend because a wildfire rapidly spread through Canada's Okanagan region.\",            \"english_title\": \"Evacuations in Canada\",            \"translated_version\": \"M\u00e1s de 12,000 personas tuvieron que evacuar el fin de semana porque un incendio se extendi\u00f3 r\u00e1pidamente por la regi\u00f3n de Okanagan en Canad\u00e1.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Evacuaciones en Canad\u00e1\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Typhoon Dolphin has reached land, bringing strong winds and heavy rain to eastern China, including Shanghai.\",            \"english_title\": \"Typhoon Dolphin Hits China\",            \"translated_version\": \"El tif\u00f3n Dolphin ha llegado a tierra, trayendo vientos fuertes y mucha lluvia al este de China, incluyendo Shangh\u00e1i.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Tif\u00f3n Dolphin en China\"        }    ]}"